{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31760","headline":"易州登龙兴寺楼望郡北高峰 · 贾岛","name":"易州登龙兴寺楼望郡北高峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡北最高峰，巉岩绝云路。\n朝来上楼望，稍觉得幽趣。\n朦胧碧烟里，羣岭若相附。\n何时一登陟，万物皆下顾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}